Subject: WifiAP: report every accepted client lifecycle transition

ndsrecomp modification to vendored melonDS src/WifiAP.cpp (GPLv3 5(a)
notice; see patches/README.md for the convention).

Calls the runner-owned nds_wifi_on_client_state_changed hook from Reset and
immediately after each accepted authentication, association, deassociation,
and deauthentication state update. The runner uses this authoritative
ClientStatus value for save-state eligibility. Backend configuration and an
idle worker thread cannot substitute for the guest station's connection
state. The hook only updates one atomic policy word and performs no polling.

--- a/src/WifiAP.cpp
+++ b/src/WifiAP.cpp
@@ (runner hook declarations)
+void nds_wifi_on_client_state_changed(uint32_t status);
@@ (WifiAP::Reset and each ClientStatus transition)
+    ::nds_wifi_on_client_state_changed((uint32_t)ClientStatus);
